# Project Scope & Tech Stack Constraints

## Project Identity
- Name: Manna Edge Markets 2.0 (MANNEDFINDER 2.0)
- Domain: Institutional Market Killzone Discovery Engine & Automated Trading Desk (Forex & Futures)

## Explicit Technology Stack
- Languages: TypeScript, JavaScript (Node.js, React 19)
- Frontend: Vite, React 19, Lightweight Charts, React Router 7, Vanilla CSS
- Backend: Express, Better-SQLite3, PostgreSQL (pg), node-cron, Puppeteer, cTrader-ts, @stoqey/ib
- Market Feeds: Yahoo Finance, TwelveData, cTrader Open API, Interactive Brokers (IBKR TWS API)

## Boundaries & Constraints
- Do NOT load, reference, or apply rules for mobile frameworks (Android/Gradle/Kotlin/Java, iOS/Swift/Xcode).
- Do NOT load or reference Firebase / Cloud Firestore / GCP mobile backend schemas.
- Do NOT load or reference life sciences, bioinformatics, or genomics databases (PDB, AlphaFold, UniProt, BLAST, etc.).
- Maintain strict focus on TypeScript web performance, institutional trading math (Risk/Reward, Killzones, MAE/MFE), and clean full-stack architecture.
